# Aquitect's Defenses: "Flash. Enchant creature you control. When this Aura enters, enchanted creature gains hexproof until end of turn. Enchanted creature gets +1/+2."
# Bot1 enchants its own Ornithopter (0/2 flying) on turn 3 (an opponent's Ornithopter is not a legal host, it enchants a creature you control: refused). It is a 1/4
# and hexproof, so Bot2, with a Mox Ruby's red open, cannot Bolt it (CR 702.11b) - while the same Bolt may target Bot1's Memnite, the positive control, which dies.
# On Bot2's turn 4 the hexproof has ended (it lasted until end of turn): the second Bolt targets the Ornithopter, which survives with 3 damage on its 4 toughness.

